# Per-Dockerfile ignore file (Docker 20.10+ with BuildKit). Scoped to the
# meta-repo's Dockerfile only.
#
# Build context is the meta-repo root. Source packages live under ./src/ and
# are bind-mounted into the container at runtime — they are NOT copied into
# the image, so excluding src/ from the build context keeps it tiny.
#
# Allowlist what the Dockerfile actually COPYs (requirements.txt + scripts/).
*
!requirements.txt
!scripts/entrypoint.sh
!scripts/restore-db.sh
